      "writtenOn": "2023-07-14T00:47:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this will increase the size of the ninja file. On aosp, the size of the ninja file for cf will increase from 3391 MB to 3435 MB `(1.29%)`. I have added this number to the CL desc.\n\nHowever, this number was also generated when only sboxing the single go action I am interested in. I experimented by sboxing every mixed build action, and that increased that file to 3534 `(4.24%)`. This is still a partial picture. As we build more of the build graph using mixed builds (and **sboxing turned on**), this number will increase.\n\nfwiw, I think this is solvable (one option is to make some changes to rulebuilder + sbox). Can the optimization of this be deferred till when this becomes a bottleneck?",
      "parentUuid": "498366ae_a7d89aa9",
